8e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"2","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘게","audio":"/audio/34e05a9677358184f75a.mp3"}},{"text":"봐","meaning":"照顾，看，看护","explanation":"보다：照顾，看，看护；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"10","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"주셔서","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주셔서","audio":"/audio/30c406af6ab8a432a63d.mp3"}},{"text":"감사합니다.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"감사하다：感谢，感激；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"감사하다","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71728","senseId":"1","lemma":"감사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감사합니다","audio":"/audio/9d3815f2e8ff35e316cf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"讨人喜欢","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"行动，动作或语气等等看起来可爱。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照顾，看，看护","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"保护或照料某人。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"552d49e405b9383e","term":"감사하다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3","entryId":"71728","definition":"觉得感恩。","pronunciation":["감ː사하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/01eceb1c0f58eb7011ec.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.187,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.kor